Comment: 0,0:04:30.00,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.00,0:04:34.46,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.08,0:04:40.00,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.46,0:04:53.06,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}才能がないことを知ったって
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}逃げ延びる理由になるのか
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2\fscx66\fscy66\pos(960,1014)}わけ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.03,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}内側に響くこの悲鳴に
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.14,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}応えてやれるのは誰だ
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.14,0:05:04.04,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}せめて生涯の幾度かは
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.98,0:05:08.78,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}正直な当事者でありたい
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.63,0:05:12.19,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}それが今日だとしたら？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.21,0:05:17.75,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.08,0:05:22.47,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.47,0:05:24.47,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}でも　気付いたんだろう
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.10,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}躰は止まれない
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.10,0:05:31.35,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「ただ　失い難い貴方を想えば」
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.35,0:05:34.97,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「くだらない恐怖だ」
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.18,0:05:36.73,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.38,0:05:39.26,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}命さえ晒し唄えば
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.58,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.59,0:05:44.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}今に分かることだ
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.62,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.49,0:05:48.84,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}ここで終わるのか
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.84,0:05:52.08,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}それは嫌だろう
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:34.46,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:40.00,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:53.06,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}才能がないことを知ったって
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}逃げ延びる理由になるのか
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1\fscx66\fscy66\pos(960,1014)}わけ
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.03,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}内側に響くこの悲鳴に
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.14,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}応えてやれるのは誰だ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:04.04,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}せめて生涯の幾度かは
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:08.78,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}正直な当事者でありたい
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.63,0:05:12.19,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}それが今日だとしたら？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:17.75,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}怖いか　また目をひらくことが
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:22.47,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}憎いか　他人事みたいな自分が
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.47,0:05:24.47,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}でも　気付いたんだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.10,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}躰は止まれない
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:31.35,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}「ただ　失い難い貴方を想えば」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:34.97,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}「くだらない恐怖だ」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:36.73,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:39.26,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}命さえ晒し唄えば
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.58,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:44.33,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}今に分かることだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.62,OP_JP_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:48.84,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}ここで終わるのか
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:52.08,OP_JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}それは嫌だろう
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.00,0:04:34.46,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐惧吗 再次睁开双眼
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.08,0:04:40.00,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨吗 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.46,0:04:53.06,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}知道自己没有才能
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}但这能成为苟且偷生的借口吗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.03,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}在内心深处响起的悲鸣
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.14,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}究竟由谁来回应
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.14,0:05:04.04,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}至少在一生中有那么几次
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.98,0:05:08.78,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}想做个正直的当事者
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.63,0:05:12.19,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}倘若那就是今天？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.21,0:05:17.75,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐惧吗 再次睁开双眼
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.08,0:05:22.47,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨吗 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.47,0:05:24.47,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}然而 你已经察觉到了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.10,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}身体已无法停滞不前
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.10,0:05:31.35,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「只因想起那不可失去的你」
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.35,0:05:34.97,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「这点恐惧便不值一提」
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.18,0:05:36.73,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.38,0:05:39.26,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}不惜性命放声高歌
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.58,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.59,0:05:44.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}此刻你便知晓
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.62,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.49,0:05:48.84,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}要在这里结束吗
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.84,0:05:52.08,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}这绝非你所愿吧
